sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client
    participant NetService as NetService
    participant NetConn as NetConnection NetSession
    participant NetSess as NetSession
    participant Dist as MessageDistributer
    participant UserSvc as UserService
    participant DB as DBService
    participant EF as ExtremeWorldEntities
    participant SQL as SQL Server
    participant DataMgr as DataManager
    participant CharMgr as CharacterManager
    participant EntMgr as EntityManager
    participant SessMgr as SessionManager
    participant MapMgr as MapManager
    participant Char as Character
    participant QuestMgr as QuestManager
    participant ItemMgr as ItemManager
    participant StatusMgr as StatusManager
    participant FriendMgr as FriendManager

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Client,SQL: Phase 1: UserLoginRequest UserService.cs:49-90
        Client->>NetService: TCP socket connect
        NetService->>NetConn: new NetConnection socket session
        Note right of NetService: 创建会话窗口
        Client->>NetConn: send UserLoginRequest
        NetConn->>NetSess: DataReceived → PackageHandler.ReceiveData
        NetSess->>Dist: 反序列化为 NetMessage
        Dist->>UserSvc: OnLogin sender request
        UserSvc->>DB: Entities.Users.Where username
        DB->>EF: LINQ query
        EF->>SQL: SELECT FROM TUser WHERE Username=?
        SQL-->>EF: TUser row
        EF-->>DB: TUser 含 TPlayer TCharacter
        DB-->>UserSvc: TUser
        UserSvc->>NetSess: Session.User = user 挂载账号
        UserSvc->>NetSess: Response.userLogin = new UserLoginResponse
        UserSvc->>NetConn: SendResponse
        NetConn->>Client: socket send UserLoginResponse
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Client,MapMgr: Phase 2: UserGameEnterRequest UserService.cs:186-218
        Client->>NetConn: send UserGameEnterRequest characterIdx=0
        NetConn->>NetSess: DataReceived → 反序列化
        NetSess->>Dist: NetMessage.Request.gameEnter
        Dist->>UserSvc: OnGameEnter sender request
        UserSvc->>UserSvc: dbchar = Session.User.Player.Characters.ElementAt idx
        Note right of UserSvc: TCharacter 在内存里 从 TPlayer.Characters

        UserSvc->>CharMgr: AddCharacter dbchar
        CharMgr->>Char: new Character Player dbchar
        activate Char
            Char->>Char: base 初始化 Entity 物理属性
            Char->>Char: this.Data = dbchar 数据库档案绑定
            Char->>StatusMgr: new StatusManager this
            StatusMgr-->>Char: statusManager
            Char->>ItemMgr: new ItemManager this
            ItemMgr->>Char: 遍历 Data.Items → Items 字典
            ItemMgr-->>Char: ItemManager
            Char->>QuestMgr: new QuestManager this
            QuestMgr->>Char: 遍历 Data.Quests → Quests 字典
            QuestMgr-->>Char: questManager
            Char->>FriendMgr: new FriendManager this
            FriendMgr->>Char: 遍历 Data.Friends → friends 字典<br/>+ NotifyOnlineStatus true
            FriendMgr-->>Char: friendManager
            Char->>Char: _bag = new NBagInfo
        deactivate Char

        CharMgr->>EntMgr: AddEntity dbchar.MapID character
        EntMgr->>Char: character.entityId = ++idx 运行时唯一 ID
        CharMgr->>CharMgr: Characters character.entityId = character

        UserSvc->>Char: character.ToCharacterBaseInfo
        Char-->>UserSvc: NCharacterInfo 拼装所有字段
        UserSvc->>NetSess: Response.gameEnter.Character = NCharacterInfo
        UserSvc->>NetSess: Session.Character = character 把角色挂到会话
        UserSvc->>MapMgr: dbchar.MapID.CharacterEnter sender character
        MapMgr->>MapMgr: MapCharacters character.entityId = MapCharacter
        MapMgr->>Client: send MapCharacterEnterResponse
        UserSvc->>SessMgr: AddSession character.Id sender
        SessMgr->>SessMgr: Sessions character.Id = sender
        UserSvc->>NetConn: SendResponse
        NetConn->>Client: socket send UserGameEnterResponse
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Client,SQL: Phase 3: Client Initialization inferred
        Client->>Client: 收到 UserGameEnterResponse NCharacterInfo
        Client->>Client: UserService.OnGameEnter → 触发角色初始化
        Client->>Client: 客户端 QuestManager / ItemManager 初始化
        Note over Client: 客户端订阅 QuestManager.OnQuestStatusChanged
    end

    Note over DataMgr: 启动时 DataManager.Load<br/>从 Data/*.txt JSON 读取<br/>QuestDefine/ItemDefine/NpcDefine 等
